really important a bit later on when we get to deep learning. So we have to represent the data in a different way for it to work. That's the basic idea. All right, so what that means is that historically, researchers would manually develop these representations. And once you develop them, once you have the representations, you can just use traditional linear regression or logistic regression and get the job done. So the whole name of the game is the representations. So in fact, people doing PhDs, for example, in computer vision,

